  articleID: 'https://NewManilaCityShelter/Events '
  title: Puppy Play Date  !
  headliner: <b>The City Dog Shelter is hosting an all-day Puppy Play Date!</b>
  bodyText: 'Need a shot of happiness ? The New Manila City Dog Shelter is opening
    its doors for an all-day Puppy Play Date this October 25th ! Local residents
    can drop in to play with rescue pups and even adopt if you find your match !

    

    

    More
    about this story :

'
  externalLinkBodyText: "Municipal Event Briefing: Citywide All-Day Puppy Play Date
    & Adoption Fair\r\n\r\nThe New Manila City Dog Shelter invites local residents
    to participate in our quarterly All-Day Puppy Play Date. This municipal initiative
    promotes early canine behavioral socialization, public education on humane pet
    ownership, and rehoming opportunities for eligible rescue puppies.\r\n\r\nInformation
    Field : Official Event Details\r\nDate & Time : Saturday, October 24, 2026 |
    9:00 AM \u2013 4:30 PM\r\nLocation : New Manila City Dog Shelter\r\nAdmission
    Fee : Free (Mandatory online pre-registration required)\r\n"
  hasExternalLink: 1
  customComments:
  - OMG PUPPIES !
  - I'll be there ! I love my doggies.
  - Do you sell cats too ?
